  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A rectangular parallelopiped is measured as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. If its specific resistance is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>, then the resistance between its two opposite rectangular faces will be _____<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0101_24bd68068884.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 159px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img height=\"294\" src=\"assets\\st0101_58c095b68a23.png\" width=\"407\" /></p><p>It is given that&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#961;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Using the formula of resistance,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mi>A</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
